uploaders to include an LSM description file.  Jeff Kopmanis is
trying to put together a database of all of the linux pacakges 
out in the world, along with availability, latest release information, 
etc. I'm planning on making his final database available via WAIS
from sunsite to allow online searching. Hopefully, this effort will
substantially reduce the amount of confusion on c.o.l. of the 
"where is ...." type.

