with this work (he has a list of over 800 packages he needs more
information on) or to find out what kind of information he'd like for
new uploads. Just put a file with a .lsm extension in /pub/Linux/Incoming,
and I'll make sure it get to him. Even if the package doesn't exist
on sunsite and never will, it'd be nice to have it in the database.

